repository-code: "https://github.com/Doulabe/calibration-lmm"
abstract: >-
  Code of the article "Finite-sample calibration of regional mixed-model
  association tests with an estimated variance ratio". The scripts compute
  the exact finite-sample distributions of the Wald, score,
  likelihood-ratio and Bayes-factor statistics of a candidate variant when
  the variance ratio of a regional polygenic background is estimated, the
  candidate-specific index nu_j and the plug-in and protected p-values.
  They run the published mixed-model and fine-mapping software on the same
  data and regenerate every table and figure of the article.
keywords:
  - "linear mixed model"
  - "variance components"
  - "finite-sample calibration"
  - "Kenward-Roger"
  - "fine-mapping"
  - "eQTL"
